WEBVTT

00:19:27.585 --> 00:19:30.245
as we will our daughter Kira,

00:19:30.245 --> 00:19:32.323
to experience firsthand

00:19:32.323 --> 00:19:36.580
the power of that astonishing design,

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.324
which on one otherwise unremarkable day in Rome,

00:19:40.324 --> 00:19:43.351
reached 2,000 years into the future

00:19:43.351 --> 00:19:46.009
to set the course for my life.

00:19:46.009 --> 00:19:48.140
Thank you.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:52.448
(Applause)